      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>LT</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
